    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "REA John Lee are delighted to present to the market this superb roadside holding extending to approximately c. 42.39 acres in total, ideally situated on the Kyle Road, just a short distance from the centre of Cappamore village, convenient to Limerick City, University of Limerick Environs.\nThis is an exceptional opportunity to acquire a substantial block of prime roadside agricultural land in a highly accessible and sought-after location. The lands benefit from extensive road frontage and are laid out in a convenient configuration, making them suitable for continued agricultural use while also offering significant long-term potential.\nA notable feature of the holding is the inclusion of approximately c. 7.9 acres of zoned development lands, providing an excellent opportunity for future residential or mixed-use development, subject to the necessary planning permission. Given its proximity to the village centre, local services and amenities, this portion of the property represents a particularly attractive prospect for developers, investors or those seeking a strategic landbank.\nThe sale includes Basic Farm Payment entitlements, which will transfer to the purchaser in accordance with Department of Agriculture regulations. Further details are available on request.\nThe property also includes a derelict farmhouse dwelling together with a small number of traditional farm buildings. While the dwelling requires complete refurbishment or redevelopment, it adds further character and potential to the holding and may suit a variety of uses, subject to planning.\nThe agricultural lands are of good quality and benefit from a prominent roadside position, making this a rare offering in the Cappamore area. Opportunities of this scale and nature, combining productive farmland, existing buildings and zoned development potential, seldom come to the market."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Prime Roadside Holding c. 42.39 acres in one or more lots\nProductive Farmland\nPart Zoned Development Lands\nExtensive Road Frontage\nDerelict Farmhouse Dwelling\nExcellent Location adjoining Cappamore\n \n Mains Services Adjacent."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "Enter Eircode V94 HE68 and the property is adjacent and opposite."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Negotiator",
        "SortOrder": 10,
        "Content": "James Lee"
      }
